<title>FRANCE: Rouen Nov 1-13 grain exports at 342,619 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Nov 1-13 grain exports at 342,619 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 342,619 tonnes between November 1 and November 13, port officials said on Tuesday</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 336,000 tonnes in the whole of November 1995.</p>
<p>The November 1-13 total included 281,476 tonnes of wheat and 61,143 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes)</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		     11,600</p>
<p>    Albania			    6,800</p>
<p>    Egypt			     71,076</p>
<p>    Britain			    9,625</p>
<p>    Italy			     69,250</p>
<p>    Kuwait			    26,250</p>
<p>    Morocco			   48,150</p>
<p>    Poland			     3,005</p>
<p>    Sudan			     27,500</p>
<p>    Turkey			     8,220</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		    55,000</p>
<p>    Greece			     2,750</p>
<p>    Italy				3,393</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
